WEBVTT

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:11.980
Intrigue in the Bakumatsu

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:29.840
On the land with the frozen moonlight

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:33.670
It's rolling and drawing the line

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:40.880
The era of destruction and rebirth now begins

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:44.550
Heavily holding the freedom

00:00:44.550 --> 00:00:48.120
Choosing the invisible path

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:55.230
Passing the sunset that's brighter than the daylight

00:00:55.230 --> 00:01:02.230
The vessel of time moves on as if telling the dream

00:01:02.230 --> 00:01:11.340
There's a new dawn beyond the dark path

00:01:12.110 --> 00:01:19.250
We may have been born from the arm of darkness

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:22.790
Just like being in an impossible love

00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:26.760
We wander into the light

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:32.000
The path stretches indefinitely

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:37.490
And there's no way to go back

00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:12.570
Matsumae Coast

00:02:16.510 --> 00:02:24.440
Shogunate Remnants Ship of the Line Kaiten

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:50.340
Matsumae Province Fukuyama Castle

00:02:53.780 --> 00:02:57.610
We'll storm in once the castle gate
is destroyed by the naval bombardment.

00:02:58.180 --> 00:02:58.850
Got it?

00:02:58.850 --> 00:02:59.650
Yes, sir!

00:03:09.690 --> 00:03:10.790
Not yet...

00:03:11.660 --> 00:03:13.320
Don't fire just yet.

00:03:14.600 --> 00:03:16.120
Not yet...

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:21.200
A half month prior to the Matsumae Invasion

00:03:34.390 --> 00:03:39.120
Iwaiso Village in Mutsunokuni

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:45.550
Mom!

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:07.740
That's your meal. Eat.

00:04:11.290 --> 00:04:13.380
If you don't eat you'll die!

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:18.200
If you don't eat you'll die!

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:19.220
Do whatever you want!

00:04:19.430 --> 00:04:20.420
Do whatever you want!

00:04:20.770 --> 00:04:22.700
Riku, hurry up and eat!

00:04:31.610 --> 00:04:36.600
We found dead and dying
victims of the war everywhere.

00:04:40.950 --> 00:04:44.440
You're the first to actually get better.

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:47.560
Where in the world did you come from?

00:05:01.810 --> 00:05:10.210
Hitotsu, higure ni gan kakete
One, make a wish on a sunset

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:13.380
Futatsu...
Two...

00:05:25.460 --> 00:05:27.290
Goodness...

00:05:28.830 --> 00:05:33.340
You know, her father went off to fight in the war
and hasn't come back since...

00:05:33.340 --> 00:05:34.740
He's just a fisherman,

00:05:34.740 --> 00:05:38.140
but you know what nonsense he told me?
"I've got things that I must do as a man!"

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:41.140
I'm sure he's already dead...

00:05:45.480 --> 00:05:46.750
Damned fool...

00:06:05.700 --> 00:06:09.040
It's impossible to launch
accurate attacks in this blizzard.

00:06:09.310 --> 00:06:11.540
That's a problem. At this rate our plan will be...

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:19.380
All depends on whether the gods
are on Enomoto's side or not.

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:29.650
Prepare to fire!

00:06:29.930 --> 00:06:30.720
Yes, sir!

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:33.530
Prepare to fire! Prepare to fire!

00:06:33.800 --> 00:06:34.860
Prepare to fire!

00:06:45.810 --> 00:06:49.340
Put your trust in me! Put your trust in Enomoto!

00:06:57.490 --> 00:06:59.420
Fire!

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:11.430
I can't believe he did it! In this weather!

00:07:16.610 --> 00:07:18.470
Everyone, prepare to move!

00:07:22.510 --> 00:07:27.690
Meanwhile, in Hakodate, the Yuguntai,
the remnants of the Hakodate Government Army,

00:07:27.690 --> 00:07:32.710
waged a battle against the vanguard
of the New Government Army.

00:07:33.830 --> 00:07:34.960
That hurts!

00:07:34.960 --> 00:07:40.060
Of course it does. You should be grateful
that you can still feel pain.

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:41.460
Now you're done.

00:07:41.830 --> 00:07:43.430
Thank you for your help.

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:44.920
Sure.

00:07:48.540 --> 00:07:50.940
Tetsu's okay, if that's what you're worried about.

00:07:50.940 --> 00:07:53.470
He's Hijikata's page, you know.

00:07:56.410 --> 00:07:57.680
Please stop it!

00:08:00.350 --> 00:08:02.150
Traitor!

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:03.450
Enemy of the court!

00:08:03.660 --> 00:08:05.820
I'll cut you down you right here!

00:08:05.820 --> 00:08:07.150
What are you doing?

00:08:07.560 --> 00:08:10.260
You two need to lower your swords!
This is a hospital!

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:13.970
Shut up! They killed my comrades
just the other day!

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:18.160
It'll be a disgrace to all samurai
if I let him go right now!

00:08:18.540 --> 00:08:23.300
You need to shut up, you dog!
I'll send you to your comrades now!

00:08:28.450 --> 00:08:32.140
If you want to kill so badly, kill me.

00:08:32.980 --> 00:08:35.580
Do it if that's what it takes to
make you feel better.

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:40.950
Go ahead.

00:08:55.170 --> 00:08:56.110
Hey...

00:08:57.380 --> 00:09:02.380
I know it's pointless to ask,
but why do you fight in the war?

00:09:02.380 --> 00:09:04.940
Why do humans kill each other?

00:09:06.120 --> 00:09:08.110
I'm not fighting in the war.

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:10.890
You are fighting!

00:09:17.830 --> 00:09:18.920
Why?

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:23.090
O Pitiable Eternal Assassin.

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:29.240
Because you don't know your own destiny,
you let destiny kill you.

00:09:32.780 --> 00:09:36.870
Maybe you samurai get it, but I just can't.

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:39.810
Daddy...

00:09:40.220 --> 00:09:44.280
No matter how much I hate it or curse it,
war will never go away.

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:52.190
That's why I decided to hate my husband,
who chose the war over us and left.

00:09:54.730 --> 00:09:57.830
But now...

00:10:08.650 --> 00:10:10.200
I'll go check on the trap.

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:20.290
You should follow your own path, Yo.

00:10:21.090 --> 00:10:28.060
I'm sure that's what he... what Ryoma Sakamoto
would want for you, too.

00:10:32.240 --> 00:10:33.230
Ryoma...

00:10:39.680 --> 00:10:43.110
So you came to kill me?

00:10:43.880 --> 00:10:49.650
I like the ocean! There's a whole
world beyond this ocean!

00:10:50.660 --> 00:10:55.390
Why don't you be my bodyguard, Akizuki?
What do you say?

00:10:57.060 --> 00:11:02.000
It's gotten to my brain... This is not good...

00:11:49.810 --> 00:11:50.870
What's the matter?

00:11:52.420 --> 00:11:53.410
What happened?

00:11:55.590 --> 00:11:56.990
Your daughter is in the water!

00:11:57.490 --> 00:11:58.650
What are you doing?

00:11:59.090 --> 00:12:01.090
It'll be too late if we don't hurry and save her!

00:12:01.090 --> 00:12:03.990
What can you do in your condition?
It'll kill you for sure this time!

00:12:04.260 --> 00:12:05.160
But!

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:08.390
Stop that nonsense!
Don't you underestimate the sea!

00:12:08.730 --> 00:12:12.360
What do you... What do you think your life is?!

00:12:26.980 --> 00:12:27.950
Fire!

00:12:35.160 --> 00:12:37.060
Now! Charge!

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:59.350
If we break through the next area we'll be inside!

00:12:59.340 --> 00:13:02.950
Fukuyama Rear Gate

00:13:05.620 --> 00:13:06.390
Fire!

00:13:12.660 --> 00:13:13.630
Rifle squad!

00:13:20.510 --> 00:13:22.600
Next! Reload!

00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:24.970
Destroy them no matter what!

00:13:27.310 --> 00:13:29.140
Mitsu... Riku...

00:13:44.530 --> 00:13:47.830
Hijikata! We can't pass here.
Let's go to the other gate!

00:13:47.830 --> 00:13:50.160
No, I believe in Enomoto!

00:13:51.670 --> 00:13:54.640
If Heaven is on Enomoto's side, then we will...

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:04.270
Target: Rear Gate! Fire!

00:14:16.660 --> 00:14:18.460
We can win this!

00:14:18.760 --> 00:14:19.790
Charge!

00:14:52.860 --> 00:14:54.020
Why you!

00:14:55.600 --> 00:14:57.260
Hijikata-sama! Hijikata...

00:15:08.280 --> 00:15:10.270
Tetsunosuke, get the flag!

00:15:11.520 --> 00:15:12.210
Y-Yes, sir!

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:14.280
<i>SHIN</i>

00:15:14.690 --> 00:15:16.210
Gakuheitai

00:15:21.390 --> 00:15:23.550
Enomoto-sama, I see our army's flags!

00:15:24.160 --> 00:15:29.860
Now I control Ezo! Victory is ours!

00:15:34.270 --> 00:15:38.540
It is the 5th day of the eleventh month, Meiji 1.
Fukuyama Castle falls.

00:15:38.840 --> 00:15:40.980
With momentum on the Enomoto Army's side,

00:15:40.980 --> 00:15:47.380
it proceeds to sack Ezashi Castle and Tate Castle,
and finally gains complete control of Ezo.

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:25.510
It looks like she's got a little fever,
but she's okay now.

00:16:26.490 --> 00:16:31.120
If you hadn't noticed...
the sea would've taken her...

00:16:35.130 --> 00:16:38.590
It happened one stormy night.

00:16:39.670 --> 00:16:44.800
The ocean took my father and brother
when they were out fishing.

00:16:51.920 --> 00:16:53.750
Big Brother!

00:16:53.850 --> 00:16:56.010
Dad!

00:17:00.090 --> 00:17:02.790
I never want to go through that again...

00:17:19.340 --> 00:17:20.310
Wait.

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:23.380
Why?

00:17:24.010 --> 00:17:27.810
Why did you even stay near the sea
after what happened?

00:17:29.050 --> 00:17:31.520
I guess it's just like war.

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:36.960
No matter how much you hate it or curse it,
the ocean will never go away.

00:17:36.960 --> 00:17:40.330
That's why I chose to hate
my father and brother instead.

00:17:40.630 --> 00:17:50.710
But... But now I've decided to learn about the
sea myself because it's never going to go away,

00:17:50.710 --> 00:17:52.680
and this is where I make my living...

00:17:53.040 --> 00:17:54.710
To learn about it yourself...

00:17:54.710 --> 00:17:57.810
Right. That's why I knew right away...

00:17:58.450 --> 00:18:02.180
Why I knew the place the sea
wanted to carry her away to...

00:18:09.790 --> 00:18:12.020
We still haven't heard from Lady Okoma.

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:15.900
But this is Yojiro we're talking about.
I'm certain he's alive somewhere out there.

00:18:15.900 --> 00:18:17.060
Right.

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:27.780
Just like you said, Yojiro won't die.

00:18:27.850 --> 00:18:30.610
No, I'm sure it won't let him.

00:18:31.220 --> 00:18:34.840
His destiny as the Eternal Assassin won't let him.

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:50.130
I've never once cursed my own destiny.
I've never hated or despised it... Not even once.

00:18:51.870 --> 00:18:56.600
It was always in front of me like it
was supposed to be... Just like this katana.

00:19:21.470 --> 00:19:24.260
I don't know if I can be like you...

00:19:24.670 --> 00:19:32.630
But I think I can start by learning more
about my own destiny.

00:19:34.710 --> 00:19:35.800
Right.

00:19:36.980 --> 00:19:38.470
Thank you for everything.

00:19:39.680 --> 00:19:41.210
Musashi, be quiet!

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:53.290
You...

00:19:54.100 --> 00:19:57.030
Dad... Dad!

00:19:57.030 --> 00:19:58.160
Riku!

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:28.630
It is the 15th day of the twelfth month.

00:20:28.730 --> 00:20:31.870
Officers of the army's high command
make notations on certain documents,

00:20:31.870 --> 00:20:33.840
in other words, they vote for and elect officials.

00:20:33.840 --> 00:20:41.740
With recognition of countries such as
England and France, the Ezo Republic is born.

00:20:57.390 --> 00:21:00.400
The curtain is not going to fall any time soon.

00:21:00.400 --> 00:21:03.760
Ezo isn't the only republic that's mine.

00:21:26.660 --> 00:21:27.890
This is...

00:21:28.490 --> 00:21:34.590
Both of you must find out the truth
of your destiny while you're alive.

00:21:35.270 --> 00:21:37.230
The time will surely come.

00:21:38.100 --> 00:21:42.970
And I know that your katana
is aware of that as well.

00:21:48.680 --> 00:21:50.240
Akizuki-sama...

00:21:58.390 --> 00:22:02.380
<i>THERE WERE WAVES</i>

00:22:03.560 --> 00:22:09.330
The hand is the sword of love

00:22:09.330 --> 00:22:18.370
It proves the beginning of all

00:22:19.140 --> 00:22:25.100
Beyond the sparkling sky

00:22:25.550 --> 00:22:30.320
The dream is still an illusion

00:22:31.460 --> 00:22:34.560
Running on the path

00:22:34.560 --> 00:22:42.070
Just like chasing the shadow of the moonlight

00:22:42.070 --> 00:22:47.840
The torn sword of love

00:22:47.840 --> 00:23:00.080
At the end of it thousands of teardrops become one

00:23:00.080 --> 00:23:05.890
And brighten tomorrow

00:23:05.890 --> 00:23:11.600
This hand is the sword of love

00:23:11.600 --> 00:23:20.300
It proves the beginning of all

00:23:32.970 --> 00:23:47.900
EPISODE 21
CROSSING OVER
THE STRAIT

00:23:34.690 --> 00:23:38.720
So you're Akizuki. Do you know me?

00:23:38.720 --> 00:23:42.790
You're Ryosuke Kuroda, commander
of the punitive forces against Ezo.

00:23:42.990 --> 00:23:45.630
Board the Stonewall with me.

00:23:45.630 --> 00:23:49.530
I'll surrender to the Republic
and offer Stonewall as a souvenir.

00:23:47.900 --> 00:24:02.570
CROSSING OVER
THE STRAIT

00:23:49.530 --> 00:23:52.640
I was asked to bring you aboard.

00:23:52.640 --> 00:23:55.970
I wonder if Yojiro can manage to reach Ezo...

00:23:55.970 --> 00:24:00.940
Either way, Yojiro is about to face
his moment of truth.
